{
  "$comment": "Universal Product Pack — the global commerce meta-model as pure data (P1-CAT-002/003). Taxonomies, attribute sets (NO columns), product-type registry, identity schemes, UOM conversions, lifecycle — all configurable. New industry = new pack data.",
